  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n (4)/(5) times 1(1)/(9) div (8)/({15)} + ( {5(1)/(4) div (3)/(7) of (1)/(4) times (2)/(7)} ) div 5(3)/(5) - (1)/(4) div (3)/(2)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n (4)/(5) times 1(1)/(9) div (8)/({15)} + ( {5(1)/(4) div (3)/(7) of (1)/(4) times (2)/(7)} ) div 5(3)/(5) - (1)/(4) div (3)/(2)\n\n⇒ (4)/(5) times(10)/(9) div (8)/({15)} + ( {(21)/(4) div (3)/(28)times (2)/(7)} ) div(28)/(5) - (1)/(4) div (3)/(2)\n\n⇒ (4)/(5) times(10)/(9) div (8)/({15)} + ( {(21)/(4) times(28)/(3)times (2)/(7)} ) div(28)/(5) - (1)/(4) div (3)/(2)\n\n⇒ (4)/(5) times(10)/(9) div (8)/({15)} + 14 div(28)/(5) - (1)/(4) div (3)/(2)\n\n⇒ (4)/(5) times(10)/(9) times (15)/({8)} + 14 times(5)/(28) - (1)/(4) times (2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (4)/(5) times(10)/(9) times (15)/({8)} + (5)/(2) - (1)/(6)\n\n⇒ {5 over 3} + {5 over 2} - {1 over 6}\n\n⇒ 4\n\n**∴ The simplied value is 4.**",
